 $f(x)+f(1-x)=\frac{100^x}{100^x + 10}+\frac{100^{1-x}}{100^{1-x} + 10}=\frac{100^x}{100^x + 10}+\frac{100}{10 \cdot 100^{x} + 100}=1$ Thus, everything cancels to get \[
